  m_ScenePath: Assets/Examples/Junkyard/Junkyard.unity
  m_ExampleName: Junkyard
  m_Category: Benchmarks
  m_Description: A kinematic pusher sweeping through thousands of small shapes in a walled yard.
  m_Purpose: 'Thousands of small shapes dropped into a walled yard made of box shapes, while a kinematic block sweeps from side to side.

    It stress-tests a large pile of bodies being continually pushed and reshuffled.'
  m_Controls: 'Object Type: circles, capsules, pentagons or a mix of all three.

    Column Count and Row Count: how many objects are dropped.

    Pusher Height and Pusher Speed: how tall the block is and how fast it sweeps from side to side.

    Gravity Scale: how hard gravity pulls.

    The object type, counts and pusher height rebuild the scene.'
